<mxCell id="title" value="&lt;b&gt;The change workflow engine: its parts, and the files they read and write&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=16;fontColor=#1f2340;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="14" width="514" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="legend1" value="Each small box is a module of the engine&amp;#x27;s package, change_workflow. Each file box below a column names what its modules read and write, and who writes it." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#4a4f6a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="38" width="1095" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="legend2" value="Arrows: a part acts on what it points to. A rail from a column&amp;#x27;s frame reaches each file below it. Dashed: outside the checkout&amp;#x27;s tracked files, or shared by every module. Validation&amp;#x27;s evidence kinds are entries of the configuration, not parts." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#4a4f6a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="54" width="1718" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
